      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Notrees began to grow in the 1940s after the discovery of large oil fields, including the TXL Field.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Notrees%2C_Texas",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In the 1950s and 1960s, Notrees thrived while oil camps operated, and Grocer Charlie Brown opened a store and became the first postmaster in 1946.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21,
        27
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
