      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Notrees%2C_Texas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "After the oil camps closed, the 1980s saw mesquite and other trees grow in Notrees, replacing the lone native tree that once stood there.",
